  "title": "Indonesia Earthquake Rescuers Continue Search Amid 53 Dead",
  "summary": "Rescue teams in Indonesia continue searching for survivors after a powerful 7.7-magnitude earthquake triggered by landslides, with over 53 deaths reported and thousands displaced. The earthquake, which struck early Saturday, caused significant damage and left many stranded overnight.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "A powerful 7.7-magnitude earthquake caused over 53 deaths and triggered landslides in eastern Indonesia.",
      "confidence": 0.95
